Assume \(U\) is shift-invariant.
For the uniform partition \(\mathcal{B}_j\) (cell size \(b=N/2^j\)),
\[
\max_{B\in\mathcal{B}_j}\sum_{i\in B} P_{ii}
=\sum_{i\in B} P_{ii}
= \frac{m}{N}\,|B|
=\frac{m}{2^j}.
\]
Equivalently, \(\mathrm{trace\_bound}_j(U)=m/2^j\).

